              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egiputa, Ubuyuda, Edomu, Amoni, Mowabu n’ababa mu bugaragwa bose mu bihugu vya kure. Kuko abo bose batakebwe vy’ukuri, kandi mbere n’ab’inzu ya Isirayeli ntibakebwe mu mitima yabo.",
          "type": "text",
